Input: {"question": "What is the population of Croydon Park?", "original_source_segments": {"D1S1": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0187-c523f76527b9:d00", "start": 0, "end": 74, "text": "along the Cooks River connecting Olympic Park at Homebush with Botany Bay."}, "D1S2": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0187-c523f76527b9:d00", "start": 75, "end": 189, "text": "There are two primary schools in Croydon Park: Croydon Park Public School and St Francis Xavier's Catholic School."}, "D1S3": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0187-c523f76527b9:d00", "start": 190, "end": 310, "text": "Croydon Park, commonly mistaken for Croydon, boasts numerous parks and parklands, particularly close to the Cooks River."}, "D1S4": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0187-c523f76527b9:d00", "start": 311, "end": 421, "text": "Picken Oval is home to the Western Suburbs Magpies Australian Rules team and is currently under redevelopment."}, "D1S5": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0187-c523f76527b9:d00", "start": 422, "end": 488, "text": "Lees Park is a homeground of Canterbury Junior Soccer Association."}, "D1S6": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0187-c523f76527b9:d00", "start": 489, "end": 572, "text": "Other parks and reserves include Flockhart Park, Rosedale Reserve and Croydon Park."}, "D1S7": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0187-c523f76527b9:d00", "start": 573, "end": 643, "text": "According to the 2016 census, Croydon Park had a population of 11,012."}, "D1S8": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0187-c523f76527b9:d00", "start": 644, "end": 654, "text": "In Croydon"}, "D2S1": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0187-c523f76527b9:d01", "start": 0, "end": 124, "text": "Croydon Park , commonly mistaken for Croydon , boasts numerous parks and parklands , particularly close to the Cooks River ."}, "D2S2": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0187-c523f76527b9:d01", "start": 125, "end": 199, "text": "Picken Oval is home to the Western Suburbs Magpies Australian Rules team ."}, "D2S3": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0187-c523f76527b9:d01", "start": 200, "end": 285, "text": "Lees Park is a homeground of Canterbury Junior Soccer Association and tennis courts ."}, "D2S4": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0187-c523f76527b9:d01", "start": 286, "end": 386, "text": "Other parks and reserves include Flockhart Park , Jackson Park , Rosedale Reserve and Croydon Park ."}, "D2S5": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0187-c523f76527b9:d01", "start": 387, "end": 561, "text": "Population [ edit ] Demographics [ edit ] According to the 2021 census , Croydon Park had a population of 10,929 , down slightly from the 11,012 recorded in the 2016 census ."}, "D2S6": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0187-c523f76527b9:d01", "start": 562, "end": 572, "text": "In Croydon"}, "D3S1": {"document_number": 3, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0187-c523f76527b9:d02", "start": 0, "end": 235, "text": "47.3 3,686,014 49.3 11,546,638 49.3 Female 5,801 52.7 3,794,217 50.7 11,855,248 50.7 Aboriginal and/or Torres Strait Islander people 74 0.7 216,176 2.9 649,171 2.8 In the 2016 Census , there were 11,012 people in Croydon Park ( NSW ) ."}, "D3S2": {"document_number": 3, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0187-c523f76527b9:d02", "start": 236, "end": 286, "text": "Of these 47.3 % were male and 52.7 % were female ."}, "D3S3": {"document_number": 3, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0187-c523f76527b9:d02", "start": 287, "end": 368, "text": "Aboriginal and/or Torres Strait Islander people made up 0.7 % of the population ."}, "D3S4": {"document_number": 3, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0187-c523f76527b9:d02", "start": 369, "end": 532, "text": "View the data quality statement for Place of Usual Residence ( PURP ) Age Croydon Park ( NSW ) % Croydon Park ( NSW ) New South Wales % New South Wales Australia %"}, "D4S1": {"document_number": 4, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0187-c523f76527b9:d03", "start": 0, "end": 61, "text": "Croydon Kings is located on the e